OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWidespread and dense fog,
OL,6,Fslowly lifting during the morning.
OL,7,FRemaining cloudy, with outbreaks of
OL,8,Frain or drizzle during the afternoon.
OL,9,FThe wind remains light for most,
OL,10,Fturning breezier along the coast later
OL,11,Fin the afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA cloudy start to the night,
OL,14,Fbut clear spells develop during the
OL,15,Flatter part of the night. A few
OL,16,Fshowers may affect coastal areas, but
OL,17,Fmost places will stay dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
