OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FSunny spells during the
OL,6,Fmorning, with cloud becoming more
OL,7,Fextensive during the afternoon.
OL,8,FIsolated light showers are possible,
OL,9,Fbut most places are expected to stay
OL,10,Fdry. Breezy along the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FHigh
OL,13,Fpressure continues to dominate in the
OL,14,Fcoming days, bringing a mix of cloudy
OL,15,Fperiods and sunny spells, with an
OL,16,Feasterly breeze. Temperatures around
OL,17,Faverage for the start of November.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
